Third-party Rust crates in polyg2p
==================================

polyg2p's Python extension (polyg2p/_polyg2p.*) in this add-on is built from
https://github.com/maxmelichov/polyg2p at @COMMIT@ (bindings/python): the
BlueV3 release bundle's own wheels on Linux and macOS, a build of the same
commit on Windows. It links the crates below statically. Each crate's source,
at the version named, is on https://crates.io/crates/<name>/<version>.

